It predicts how small molecules (ligands) bind to proteins (receptors)

Calculate binding energy to find the best fit.
It generates multiple possible poses of ligand - protein binding 

** Fast, Accurate & widely used in drug discovery.

Why ?
1. It saves time & money before doing lab experiments.
2. It helps design new medicines for cancer, diabetes,infections etc.,
3. A foundation tool in computer-aided drug design (CADD)

**** Right fit (full of locks proteins ) = Door Opens ( Drugs - keys - small moelcule ligand ) ******
